# /ism/ — Image Scale Metadata (ISM)
#
# An open format for carrying the true scale of an image inside the image
# file (XMP). The namespace is https://w3id.org/ism/<version>/ .
#
# https://w3id.org/ism/        -> https://image-scale-metadata.github.io/
# https://w3id.org/ism/0.1/    -> https://image-scale-metadata.github.io/
# https://w3id.org/ism/<path>  -> https://image-scale-metadata.github.io/<path>
#
# ## Contact
# This space is administered by:
#
# Daniel Lindskog
# GitHub username: Arkeologibyran
# GitHub organisation: image-scale-metadata

RewriteEngine on

# A version namespace resolves to the specification.
RewriteRule ^[0-9]+\.[0-9]+/?$ https://image-scale-metadata.github.io/ [R=302,L]

# Everything else maps one to one onto the project site.
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://image-scale-metadata.github.io/$1 [R=302,L]
